{"id":"76305a7e4d824323","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","title":"Differential Operator","display":"df-differential-operator — Differential Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differential-operator","aliases":["58-df-differential-operator","Differential Operator"],"display":"df-differential-operator — Differential Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differential-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differential-operator</span><span>Differential Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differential-operator — Differential Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\Omega,n,m\\in V\">\\(L,\\Omega,n,m\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\\)</span> (Euclidean standard topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Open}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Open}_S\\)</span> (开集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (线性映射谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\\)</span> (光滑函数空间与偏导数塔, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (多重指标的典范坐标词谓词，本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (由偏导数塔定义的多重偏导图，本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (本文件定义的恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 阶微分算子谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>标量函数送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=1\">\\(m=1\\)</span> 的偏导数塔前，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S\\)</span>；塔的输出使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S\\)</span>。两者由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> 的五参数实值接口不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\\)</span>，取 <code>58-df-euclidean-topological-data</code> 的显式欧氏拓扑，不是可任意重选的拓扑参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\">\\(|\\alpha|\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\)</span>；此定义同时用于三个谓词中的多重指标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}word}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(w,|\\alpha|,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j,k\\in|\\alpha|\\;(j&lt;k\\to w(j)\\leq w(k))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\left|\\{j\\in|\\alpha|\\mid w(j)=i\\}\\right|=\\alpha(i),\n\\qquad |\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}word}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(w,|\\alpha|,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j,k\\in|\\alpha|\\;(j&lt;k\\to w(j)\\leq w(k))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\left|\\{j\\in|\\alpha|\\mid w(j)=i\\}\\right|=\\alpha(i),\n\\qquad |\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}multi\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists w,F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(u,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,|\\alpha|)\n\\land y=\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(F(w),\\Omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}multi\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists w,F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(u,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,|\\alpha|)\n\\land y=\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(F(w),\\Omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\Omega\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R),C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists a\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(a,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(y,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq m\\to\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y(\\alpha),u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;L(u)(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq m}}a(\\alpha)(x)\\,y(\\alpha)(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|=m\\land a(\\alpha)\\ne\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\Omega\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R),C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists a\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(a,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(y,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq m\\to\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y(\\alpha),u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;L(u)(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq m}}a(\\alpha)(x)\\,y(\\alpha)(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|=m\\land a(\\alpha)\\ne\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S\\)</span> 把多重指标转换成唯一的非降坐标词；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> 直接复用光滑函数定义中的偏导数塔，而不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\alpha\">\\(D^\\alpha\\)</span> 当作未定义原语。</li>\n<li>最高阶系数非零把“阶数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>”收紧为“恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 阶”；非空条件排除空开集上的退化表示。</li>\n<li>椭圆性与主符号是依赖本定义的后续概念，不在同一 assertion 中重复定义。</li>\n<li>对标量算子，椭圆性要求主符号在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Omega\">\\(x\\in\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\neq0\">\\(\\xi\\neq0\\)</span> 时非零；“所有特征值非零”只适用于相应的系统表述。</li>\n<li>Parabolic: heat equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_t - \\Delta\">\\(\\partial_t - \\Delta\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hyperbolic: wave equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_t^2 - \\Delta\">\\(\\partial_t^2 - \\Delta\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Taylor, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (开集谓词, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}$ (线性映射谓词, see [[58-df-linear-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)$ and $\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S$ (光滑函数空间与偏导数塔, see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标量函数送入 $m=1$ 的偏导数塔前，使用 $\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S$；塔的输出使用 $\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S$。两者由 [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]] 定义，$\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S$ 的五参数实值接口不变。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\Omega,n,m\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Open}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"|\\alpha|\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}word}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(w,|\\alpha|,n)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall j,k\\in|\\alpha|\\;(j<k\\to w(j)\\leq w(k))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\left|\\{j\\in|\\alpha|\\mid w(j)=i\\}\\right|=\\alpha(i),\n\\qquad |\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator\\text{-}multi\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists w,F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S(w,\\alpha,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(u,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,|\\alpha|)\n\\land y=\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(F(w),\\Omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\Omega\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R),C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists a\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(a,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}\\bigl(y,\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\mid|\\alpha|\\leq m\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq m\\to\n\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(y(\\alpha),u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;L(u)(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq m}}a(\\alpha)(x)\\,y(\\alpha)(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{11mm}\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|=m\\land a(\\alpha)\\ne\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalWord}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi\\neq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_t - \\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_t^2 - \\Delta","display":false}],"bytes":4569,"backlinks":[{"id":"efadc4e149119d7f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S$、$\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S$ 与 $C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]。"},{"id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 